  "description": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>A simple mod that makes the “Receive all” button in the messenger actually collect all attachments from all chats.<br />\nParticularly useful for users of the mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2655/stat-rewards\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Stat Rewards by Chazut</a> who constantly have to collect lots of attachments.</p>\n<p>Thanks to the new server component, retrieval now happens instantly, regardless of the number of messages.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>As usual, unzip to your SPT directory</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Let me know if you run into any problems or have suggestions for improvement.</p>\n",
