      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>“Receive All” is now instant.</strong> This version adds an optional server mod that\ncollects the attachments from <em>all</em> your chats in a single request - no more\nlong waits with big mailboxes. The mod still works fine without it (it falls\nback automatically, and even that path got faster).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Fixed:</strong> with roughly 30+ chats, older\nversions could make the chat selection keep snapping back to one dialogue for\nup to a minute after opening the messenger. Updating the client plugin alone\nfixes this.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
